  "question": {
    "text": "The least value of the product <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;(such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;are positive real numbers) for which the determinant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>y</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>z</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math> is non-negative is"
  },
