  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Since&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mi>&#160;</mi><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>y</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mi>&#160;</mi><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>z</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now determinant is non-negative</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Least value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>"
